          <p>
            Where ON's shake earns a look is its protein source: milk protein isolate is a more refined ingredient than concentrate and caseinate, which some buyers find sits better. It is also worth knowing that ON sells a separate ultra-filtered milk protein shake with 30 g of protein and fiber, which is a different product from the Gold Standard carton. If you are weighing Premier against other carton brands, see <a href="/muscle-milk-vs-premier-protein/">Muscle Milk vs Premier Protein</a> and <a href="/premier-protein-vs-ensure/">Premier Protein vs Ensure</a>.
