                  Optimum Nutrition Gold Standard 100% Whey lists sunflower and/or soy lecithin and declares soy as an allergen, per the label at the time of writing. Premier Protein 100% Whey uses sunflower lecithin and is marketed as soy-free. If you need to avoid soy entirely, Premier's powder is the safer choice of the two.
